MODULE: UndoExcludesCompetitorIgnoresUndo
TARGET: UndoExcludesCompetitor
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: competing work ignores a pending or running undo
PERTURBS: CompetitorAdmit

--- FIND
    /\ resize \notin {"announced", "active"} /\ undo \in {"idle", "done"}
--- REPLACE
    /\ resize \notin {"announced", "active"}
--- END
